WEBVTT

00:09.080 --> 00:11.160
The Sikong family's realm.

00:12.600 --> 00:16.267
Cannot be stained with the blood of our own clan again.

00:34.440 --> 00:40.280
Father clearly said this wound was almost healed how is this I've thought for a long time.

00:41.440 --> 00:44.773
And decided to pass the throne to your elder brother.

00:49.080 --> 00:50.640
In times of chaos.

00:51.880 --> 00:56.840
Xuan Kingdom needs bravery fierceness and ruthlessness.

01:03.640 --> 01:08.640
But to govern in peace Your elder brother is more suitable than I or you.

01:08.720 --> 01:10.120
More suitable.

01:16.800 --> 01:19.360
Do you think I'm being unfair?

01:21.480 --> 01:22.840
No.

01:22.920 --> 01:25.480
Your son is willing to assist elder brother.

01:30.400 --> 01:31.920
I remember everything.

01:32.640 --> 01:37.680
The Tiannan Pass battlefield you alone lured Shilang into the pass.

01:38.240 --> 01:39.640
That battle.

01:41.600 --> 01:46.627
You were hit by two blades got back on your horse and fought again.

01:46.880 --> 01:48.280
Further north.

01:49.240 --> 01:50.640
Your chest.

01:51.520 --> 01:54.440
Shoulder back.

01:55.800 --> 01:57.200
All have arrow wounds.

01:58.360 --> 02:00.880
Every wound you suffered for Xuan Kingdom.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.880
I remember.

02:06.760 --> 02:08.160
Father.

02:12.600 --> 02:14.600
Your temper is most like mine.

02:15.520 --> 02:17.040
I sometimes think.

02:17.720 --> 02:23.200
When the realm is at peace you can travel the mountains and rivers for me.

02:24.160 --> 02:27.280
See beautiful scenery and people everywhere.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.640
Free as an immortal.

02:33.520 --> 02:35.187
But after all, some things.

02:36.400 --> 02:38.640
I must burden you with.

02:39.680 --> 02:41.080
Father.

02:45.360 --> 02:49.440
Your elder brother has it hard help him for me.

02:50.760 --> 02:52.160
Assist him.

02:53.760 --> 02:58.560
And protect what we two worked so hard to conquer.

03:00.560 --> 03:01.960
Second son.

03:04.080 --> 03:05.440
Can you promise me?

03:11.240 --> 03:12.640
Your son promises.

03:13.320 --> 03:18.160
Your son guarantees to do everything to protect Xuan Kingdom.

03:21.160 --> 03:22.560
Rise.

03:29.320 --> 03:30.840
Good child.

